35,2,1,talk,May,,"The ferry trial worked, but the data terms were never agreed.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is empty. Overtime is covering everything.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The mid-city route is slower, but the platforms clear fine.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The pre-war shells are a nightmare. Bidders are pricing in huge risks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The capital ledger is tight. Ticketing fees are eating the paving budget.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, that explains why the station work is so risky.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, so the crowding isn't the issue? The waiting is.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,Exactly. The audits show waiting for connections is the real cost.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,The joint minutes confirm the back offices are still misaligned.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,The technology line was trimmed. We can't afford a new platform easily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The late-evening pilot met its cost target. That is promising.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,But the crews are a third below establishment. We can't staff it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"If we fix the connections, we might not need the night extension.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The accessibility programme had mixed results. Some lifts failed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The ring-fenced grant is gone. We are on operating subsidy now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
